			{
				"type": "CSSComment",
				"value": " postcss's `splitWord` reads a word matching its own NUMBER production as a\n\t\tnumeric node, never a function name, and then fabricates a gap ahead of the group\n\t\tit synthesizes — tsv reads the whole word as the name and keeps the authoring ",
